			<div class="copy"><h2>Heavy-Metal and Pesticide Testing</h2><p>Heavy-metal analysis is an important part of the quality-control process for applicable raw materials and finished products.</p><p>ICP-MS technology may be used to quantify metals present within an ingredient or formula.</p><p>Pesticide testing is also performed when applicable based on the botanical, ingredient and established quality specifications.</p><p>These additional safeguards are especially important to us because quality is about more than what is added to a product—it is also about carefully evaluating what should not be there.</p></div>
